TY  - JOUR
ID  - arxiv-2108.09349v2
AU  - NIMERSHIEM, BARBARA
TI  - GEOMETRIC TRIANGULATIONS OF A FAMILY OF HYPERBOLIC 3-BRAIDS
DA  - D:20220624
UR  - https://arxiv.org/abs/2108.09349
AB  - We construct topological triangulations for complements of (−2, 3, n)-pretzel knots and links with n ≥7. Following a procedure outlined by Futer and Gu´eritaud, we use a theorem of Casson and Rivin to prove the constructed triangulations are geometric. Futer, Kalfagianni, and Purcell have shown (indirectly) that such braids are hyperbolic. The new result here is a direct proof.
ER  - 
